    "title": "Man arrested in connection to Birmingham robbery investigation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBRC Digital Staff ,\n3 hours ago BIRMINGHAM, Ala. (WBRC) - One person has been arrested in connection to a robbery investigation in Birmingham. According to Birmingham Police, 53-year-old Samuel Bolton was arrested after a robbery in the 1600 block of 14th Avenue South Sunday, April 12. Authorities say the victim in the robbery was not injured... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
